<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the week July 14-20 and the total for 1997/98.</p>
<p>	     July 14-20    July 15-21	TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1997/98     1996/97	1997/98	1996/97</p>
<p> Stocks/open    246,796.4   218,099.8</p>
<p> Production	43,379.2    28,930.4     186,133.3    105,145.2</p>
<p> Shipment	  10,003.8    18,823.6	29,183.4     46,278.7</p>
<p> Home Market	  247.2	 188.0	   937.4	  788.5</p>
<p> Stocks/close   279,924.6   228,018.6</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
